{"data":[{"id":3,"name":"Region XI Wildlife Rescue Center","type":"Explore Wildlife","description":"Discover the Wild Side of Tagum! Visit the Wildlife Rescue Center in New Balamban, Tagum City \u2014 a sanctuary made possible \ud835\ude5e\ud835\ude63 \ud835\ude65\ud835\ude56\ud835\ude67\ud835\ude69\ud835\ude63\ud835\ude5a\ud835\ude67\ud835\ude68\ud835\ude5d\ud835\ude5e\ud835\ude65 \ud835\ude6c\ud835\ude5e\ud835\ude69\ud835\ude5d \ud835\ude69\ud835\ude5d\ud835\ude5a \ud835\ude47\ud835\ude42\ud835\ude50 \ud835\ude64\ud835\ude5b \ud835\ude4f\ud835\ude56\ud835\ude5c\ud835\ude6a\ud835\ude62 \ud835\ude56\ud835\ude63\ud835\ude59 \ud835\ude3f\ud835\ude40\ud835\ude49\ud835\ude4d, where you can witness monkeys and other rescued wildlife up close in their natural habitat. \ud83c\udf3f\ud83e\udd9c ","date":"2025-06-08","link":null,"image":"..\/images\/experiences\/experience_1773732204_69b9016c0f713.jpg","featured":0,"created_at":"2026-03-24 23:53:22"},{"id":2,"name":"Children's Park","type":"Playground","description":"The Children\u2019s Park in Tagum City is a family-friendly recreational area designed to provide a safe, fun, and relaxing environment for children and visitors of all ages. Located within the city\u2019s well-known Energy Park, the park features colorful playground equipment, open spaces, picnic areas, and resting spots where families can enjoy quality time together.","date":"2025-07-08","link":null,"image":"..\/images\/experiences\/experience_1773718644_69b8cc743abfc.jpg","featured":0,"created_at":"2026-03-24 23:53:22"},{"id":1,"name":"Fe Misa Ayala Seniors Park","type":"wellness","description":"Fe Misa Ayala Seniors Park is a public wellness and recreational park in Tagum City dedicated primarily to senior citizens while remaining open for all visitors. The park is known for its peaceful atmosphere, landscaped surroundings, and free outdoor fitness equipment that encourage healthy and active lifestyles among the elderly.","date":"2025-04-11","link":null,"image":"..\/images\/experiences\/experience_1773714351_69b8bbaf9e35e.jpg","featured":1,"created_at":"2026-03-24 23:53:22"}],"timestamp":1787706169}